'''Timeless Jewel''' is the basetype of a set of six [[List of unique jewels|unique jewels]] that can alter the [[Passive skill|passive tree]] nodes.

==Mechanics==
{{main|Historic}}

All unique Timeless Jewel are {{c|mod|[[Historic]]}}, modifying passives and keystones in radius with an additional effect or transforming them into new ones based on the seed value and name on its modifier.

When [[vendor recipe system|vendored]], [[Legion]] Timeless Jewels will sell for 10x of their corresponding faction's [[Timeless Splinter]]s.

===Non-unique Timeless Jewel===
Players can obtain a non-unique Timeless Jewel by [[corrupt]]ing unique Timeless Jewels into rares, then selling five corrupted rare Timeless Jewel to a [[vendor]] for an uncorrupted rare. Like the {{il|Prismatic Jewel}} base, a non-unique non-corrupted Timeless Jewel can roll any explicit modifiers from {{il|Cobalt Jewel|Cobalt}}, {{il|Crimson Jewel|Crimson}} and {{il|Viridian Jewel|Viridian Jewels}}.

{{Item unique versions}}

{{Item acquisition}}

Timeless Jewels can only drop as unique items.

Non-unique Timeless Jewels can only be obtained by [[Corrupted|corrupting]] a unique Timeless Jewel into a rare. A non-corrupted Timeless Jewel can be obtained by selling five corrupted rare Timeless Jewels to a [[vendor]].

